WEBVTT

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:31.056
Lot of logic in this example,
lot of fairness and justice,

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.136
real open-minded play.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:37.336
Felice is not a detective,
she only plays one onstage.

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:40.376
And when I say that,
I say it as a private investigator,

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.456
licensed in the state of New York.

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.496
(Laughter)

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:47.656
FB: Sherlock Holmes
doesn't need a license.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:48.696
(Laughter)

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.216
He solves crime. So do I.

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:54.016
Using science and my intuition.

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:56.936
Everything I know about
detective work, I learned on TV.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:59.016
JM: Episode two.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:01.296
How we became sisters.